  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The demolition works hereby approved shall be carried out in accordance with the following details submitted with application:&nbsp; Demolition / Refurbishment Asbestos Survey Report&nbsp; 55&nbsp; – 63 Grange Farm Close Harrow dated 1st September 2025 by Airsafe, Demolition / Refurbishment Asbestos Survey Report&nbsp; 73 – 81 Grange Farm Close Harrow dated 1st September 2025 by Airsafe, Proposed Method Statement and Risk Assessments by Ikon Rev 2 dated December 2025, Site Notice s x6 dated 6th November 2025, Cover letter by Stantec dated 6 November 2025, Drw No: GFE-PTE-ZZ-XX-DR-A-99013 Rev 06.REASON: To ensure that all works are carried out suitably in relation to adjoining properties in the interests of the amenity of neighbouring residents, the appearance of the development and public safety.",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the Asbestos Survey hereby approved, prior to the\r\ndemolition of the buildings on the application site, access will be\r\nobtained to all previously inaccessible voids where possible and a further\r\nAsbestos Survey shall be carried out by a suitably\r\nqualified person to inspect these areas.&amp;nbsp; In\r\nthe event asbestos-containing materials are identified, details of all measures\r\nnecessary for their safe removal and disposal to prevent contamination of the\r\nsite and surrounding environment shall be submitted and approved in writing by\r\nthe LPA.&amp;nbsp; Should any unforeseen asbestos be found on the site its handling\r\nand disposal must be carried out in accordance with the Control of Asbestos\r\nRegulations 2012 and guidance provided by the HSE - &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hse.gov.uk%2Fasbestos%2Findex.htm&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CNicola.Rankin%40harrow.gov.uk%7C381c4bfb84f74f228e5f08de367a0b0f%7Cd2c39953a8db4c3c97f2d2dc76fb3e2c%7C1%7C0%7C639008095022794177%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=d%2FXw6%2F%2FUUTDf84KGonyiFOIrJ6Upzh3hy7kOtmlAqgg%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;https://www.hse.gov.uk/asbestos/index.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u1:p&gt;&lt;/u1:p&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Demolition shall thereafter be carried out strictly in accordance with\r\nthe approved details.&lt;u1:p&gt;&lt;/u1:p&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;u1:p&gt;&lt;/u1:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reason: To ensure that the demolition of existing buildings does not\r\nresult in contamination of the site or pose a risk to human health or the\r\nenvironment, in the interests of public safety and environmental protection&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#156082&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;u1:p&gt;&lt;/u1:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
